WEBVTT

00:00:01.121 --> 00:00:04.050
They planted ship’s
spars three feet deep.

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.900
Wind still came through the walls,

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.548
so the men tied up bundles
of grass for thatch.

00:00:11.102 --> 00:00:13.914
Two panes from the cabin
let in daylight.

00:00:13.914 --> 00:00:16.514
Raynal carved chessmen
with his pocketknife.

00:00:16.514 --> 00:00:19.577
He used soot for the black
squares and lime for the white.

